---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { BLOG_TITLE } from "../lib/constants";
import BlogPostList from "../components/BlogPostList.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
    pageTitle={BLOG_TITLE}
    pageDescription="Blog about Rika's experiences and thoughts."
/>
<div class="body-wrapper" role="main">
    <section class="hero">
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">LOVE AND DEEPSPACE</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title"><em>Rika's</em> Blog</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">
            Okay, here's my confession - I have so many thoughts about Love &
            Deepspace. Yeah, I know! There're plenty of other great games out
            there, but this one just hit me differently. It left such a deep
            impression on me that I ended up creating content about it. <br
            /><br />
            But the part where I gather all my thoughts and put them into words? Yeah,
            that's a challenge for me. <br /><br />So this blog is my attempt to
            change that. I want to create a space where I can share my thoughts,
            experiences, random ramblings and everything in between. It's also a
            way for me to practice writing and learn to express myself better
            along the way.<br /><br />One post at a time. One small step at a
            time. <br /><br />Anyway, thanks for being here and don't forget to
            say hi! I don't bite... usually.
        </p>
    </section>
    <BlogPostList />
    <Footer />
</div>
